        ":question/problem": "Calculate $A-B$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
